# Private clean-room blocklist for scripts/planning/verify-package.sh.
#
# Copy to cleanroom-patterns.local (gitignored) and tailor: one extended-regex
# alternation on the first non-comment line — every term that must NEVER appear in
# this public repo's committed docs (employer/product codenames, internal hostnames,
# internal ticket-id shapes, your local username). The verify gate fails closed when
# the .local file is missing.
#
# Generic patterns (PAT/token shapes, /Users/<name> paths) are built into the script
# itself — list only what is private to you here.
internal-codename|internal-product-name|INTERNAL-[0-9]{4,}|internal\.host\.example
